1
00:01:26,982 --> 00:01:28,210
<font color="#FFFFFF">Wh-What's that?</font>

2
00:01:33,505 --> 00:01:34,874
<font color="#FFFFFF">Just a little more.</font>

3
00:02:04,444 --> 00:02:06,202
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're pretty good.</font>

4
00:02:32,046 --> 00:02:35,213
<font color="#FFFFFF">Now that's a handy Jinchuriki.</font>

5
00:02:38,740 --> 00:02:41,567
<font color="#FFFFFF">But... how'd you know
I was the intruder?</font>

6
00:02:44,034 --> 00:02:46,662
<font color="#FFFFFF">There are no birds like that
in this desert.</font>

7
00:02:47,201 --> 00:02:48,460
<font color="#FFFFFF">I see.</font>

8
00:04:20,568 --> 00:04:24,334
<font color="#FFFFFF">The Jinchuriki of the Sand</font>

9
00:04:40,118 --> 00:04:41,886
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're pretty good...</font>

10
00:05:07,960 --> 00:05:11,287
<font color="#FFFFFF">Now that's a handy Jinchuriki.</font>

11
00:05:14,484 --> 00:05:17,081
<font color="#FFFFFF">But... how'd you know
I was the intruder?</font>

12
00:05:19,779 --> 00:05:22,476
<font color="#FFFFFF">There are no birds like that
in this desert.</font>

13
00:05:23,145 --> 00:05:24,374
<font color="#FFFFFF">I see.</font>

14
00:05:25,003 --> 00:05:27,301
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey! What was that noise earlier?</font>

15
00:05:27,571 --> 00:05:29,838
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're supposed to report immediately
if something happens...</font>

16
00:05:34,963 --> 00:05:36,332
<font color="#FFFFFF">Wh-What... happened?</font>

17
00:05:43,725 --> 00:05:45,053
<font color="#FFFFFF">Lord Kazekage...</font>

18
00:05:45,523 --> 00:05:48,450
<font color="#FFFFFF">What do you mean something strange
got into the village?</font>

19
00:05:48,879 --> 00:05:52,446
<font color="#FFFFFF">Captain Yura was supposed to have
tightened village security.</font>

20
00:05:52,716 --> 00:05:57,111
<font color="#FFFFFF">Actually... we have been unable to
contact Captain Yura.</font>

21
00:05:58,670 --> 00:05:59,669
<font color="#FFFFFF">Come again?</font>

22
00:06:01,067 --> 00:06:06,702
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, man... That Deidara had to go
and turn this into a circus.</font>

23
00:06:07,701 --> 00:06:08,630
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yura.</font>

24
00:06:09,229 --> 00:06:10,897
<font color="#FFFFFF">You head on back.</font>

25
00:06:11,397 --> 00:06:14,923
<font color="#FFFFFF">Things will get complicated if the guys
from the village find you here.</font>

26
00:06:15,323 --> 00:06:17,021
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes, Lord Sasori.</font>

27
00:06:19,019 --> 00:06:21,387
<font color="#FFFFFF">Get a move on, Deidara.</font>

28
00:06:22,346 --> 00:06:25,543
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't like to be kept waiting.</font>

29
00:06:28,280 --> 00:06:29,609
<font color="#FFFFFF">Gaara! I'm coming in!</font>

30
00:06:38,130 --> 00:06:39,469
<font color="#FFFFFF">Where'd he go...?</font>

31
00:06:40,098 --> 00:06:43,724
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kankuro, the Kazekage is fighting
up in the sky.</font>

32
00:06:44,094 --> 00:06:45,593
<font color="#FFFFFF">Wh-What did you say?</font>

33
00:06:53,714 --> 00:06:54,484
<font color="#FFFFFF">Gaara...!</font>

34
00:07:12,765 --> 00:07:14,963
<font color="#FFFFFF">The covert action is a failure.</font>

35
00:07:19,589 --> 00:07:21,057
<font color="#FFFFFF">But now...</font>

36
00:07:21,387 --> 00:07:24,454
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't have to bother...
looking for you anymore...!</font>

37
00:07:46,861 --> 00:07:48,759
<font color="#FFFFFF">He's got the advantage,
as expected...</font>

38
00:07:49,329 --> 00:07:50,797
<font color="#FFFFFF">This is a real mess.</font>

39
00:07:57,551 --> 00:07:58,550
<font color="#FFFFFF">Over there?</font>

40
00:08:04,883 --> 00:08:05,613
<font color="#FFFFFF">This one is?</font>

41
00:08:08,210 --> 00:08:10,438
<font color="#FFFFFF">A transformation of one
of Naruto's Shadow Clones, huh?</font>

42
00:08:14,204 --> 00:08:16,032
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm finished if it even grazes me...</font>

43
00:08:49,269 --> 00:08:53,135
<font color="#FFFFFF">Shinobi Battle Skills, part three...</font>

44
00:08:57,730 --> 00:08:58,759
<font color="#FFFFFF">Ninjutsu!</font>

45
00:09:02,825 --> 00:09:04,554
<font color="#FFFFFF">The speed of his seal forming...</font>

46
00:09:04,883 --> 00:09:06,322
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's way too fast!</font>

47
00:09:09,519 --> 00:09:11,946
<font color="#FFFFFF">Fire Style! Fireball Jutsu!</font>

48
00:09:32,995 --> 00:09:34,424
<font color="#FFFFFF">Where's Kakashi Sensei?</font>

49
00:09:37,051 --> 00:09:39,489
<font color="#FFFFFF">Earth Style: Headhunter Jutsu!</font>

50
00:09:48,440 --> 00:09:49,509
<font color="#FFFFFF">A Shadow Clone, huh?</font>

51
00:09:57,131 --> 00:09:59,628
<font color="#FFFFFF">Water Style! Water Dragon Missile!</font>

52
00:10:06,492 --> 00:10:07,461
<font color="#FFFFFF">What?</font>

53
00:10:39,588 --> 00:10:43,125
<font color="#FFFFFF">Using Fire Style, Earth Style
and Water Style consecutively.</font>

54
00:10:43,355 --> 00:10:44,953
<font color="#FFFFFF">Ordinarily that's totally impossible.</font>

55
00:10:45,153 --> 00:10:47,820
<font color="#FFFFFF">He isn't called the "Copy Ninja"
for nothing...</font>

56
00:10:48,250 --> 00:10:51,147
<font color="#FFFFFF">Now I understand how amazing he is.</font>

57
00:10:51,476 --> 00:10:52,416
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah...</font>

58
00:10:57,510 --> 00:11:00,038
<font color="#FFFFFF">This is going to be
a long-drawn-out affair.</font>

59
00:11:03,205 --> 00:11:06,232
<font color="#FFFFFF">But there's still plenty of time
until dawn.</font>

60
00:11:06,561 --> 00:11:07,361
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes, there is.</font>

61
00:11:07,560 --> 00:11:09,429
<font color="#FFFFFF">Things might just be settled...</font>

62
00:11:10,158 --> 00:11:12,096
<font color="#FFFFFF">more quickly than you'd expect...</font>

63
00:11:32,475 --> 00:11:33,405
<font color="#FFFFFF">Gaara...</font>

64
00:11:40,467 --> 00:11:41,696
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's almost time...</font>

65
00:12:36,741 --> 00:12:38,669
<font color="#FFFFFF">The real show's about to begin.</font>

66
00:13:12,775 --> 00:13:13,904
<font color="#FFFFFF">There!</font>

67
00:13:30,357 --> 00:13:35,482
<font color="#FFFFFF">He uses strange explosives...
And he's able to guide them, huh?</font>

68
00:13:40,307 --> 00:13:43,275
<font color="#FFFFFF">I've pretty much got it now.</font>

69
00:13:55,233 --> 00:13:56,561
<font color="#FFFFFF">I always knew, but...</font>

70
00:13:57,161 --> 00:13:59,588
<font color="#FFFFFF">The Sharingan is really
something else, isn't it?</font>

71
00:13:59,758 --> 00:14:00,657
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah...</font>

72
00:14:01,127 --> 00:14:04,753
<font color="#FFFFFF">But even more than that,
the speed of his seal formation...</font>

73
00:14:04,783 --> 00:14:07,181
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's so fast it's tough for us
to even get near him...</font>

74
00:14:13,444 --> 00:14:15,812
<font color="#FFFFFF">Fire Style! Fireball Jutsu!</font>

75
00:14:22,405 --> 00:14:24,863
<font color="#FFFFFF">Water Style! Water Dragon Jutsu!</font>

76
00:14:32,156 --> 00:14:33,225
<font color="#FFFFFF">For the time being,</font>

77
00:14:33,254 --> 00:14:35,153
<font color="#FFFFFF">we won't have a prayer of getting
the bells</font>

78
00:14:35,193 --> 00:14:36,821
<font color="#FFFFFF">unless we can do something
about both his hands.</font>

79
00:14:36,951 --> 00:14:42,216
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah. That Kakashi Sensei's
incredibly strong for sure.</font>

80
00:14:44,184 --> 00:14:45,882
<font color="#FFFFFF">He's smarter than Shikamaru.</font>

81
00:14:47,810 --> 00:14:49,808
<font color="#FFFFFF">He has a better sense of smell
than Kiba.</font>

82
00:14:50,837 --> 00:14:52,505
<font color="#FFFFFF">His Sharingan is better
than Sasuke's.</font>

83
00:14:54,034 --> 00:14:56,032
<font color="#FFFFFF">His Taijutsu is better than
Bushy Brow's.</font>

84
00:14:57,230 --> 00:15:00,527
<font color="#FFFFFF">And he's got way more...
experience than us...</font>

85
00:15:00,797 --> 00:15:04,223
<font color="#FFFFFF">But even Kakashi Sensei must
have a weakness!</font>

86
00:15:04,763 --> 00:15:06,291
<font color="#FFFFFF">If we think hard about it...</font>

87
00:15:07,990 --> 00:15:10,487
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hmm. A weakness, huh...?</font>

88
00:15:28,339 --> 00:15:30,897
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh! He does...
have a weakness?</font>

89
00:15:31,167 --> 00:15:31,936
<font color="#FFFFFF">What?</font>

90
00:15:42,285 --> 00:15:45,182
<font color="#FFFFFF">I never thought they'd make me
use my Sharingan this much...</font>

91
00:15:46,481 --> 00:15:47,750
<font color="#FFFFFF">But, oh well...</font>

92
00:15:47,780 --> 00:15:49,578
<font color="#FFFFFF">I should be able to hang on
until sunrise...</font>

93
00:15:51,816 --> 00:15:55,542
<font color="#FFFFFF">I've still got... Shuriken...
and Kunai Knives.</font>

94
00:15:55,872 --> 00:15:57,570
<font color="#FFFFFF">Whoops! Mustn't do that.</font>

95
00:15:57,840 --> 00:15:59,268
<font color="#FFFFFF">This isn't like the old days.</font>

96
00:15:59,308 --> 00:16:02,205
<font color="#FFFFFF">They're too good for me to be
able to fight them while reading.</font>

97
00:16:03,934 --> 00:16:05,802
<font color="#FFFFFF">But I want to know what happens.</font>

98
00:16:05,832 --> 00:16:08,259
<font color="#FFFFFF">It seems the main character
in "Make-Out Tactics"</font>

99
00:16:08,299 --> 00:16:10,897
<font color="#FFFFFF">has some sort of incredible secret...</font>

100
00:16:11,726 --> 00:16:14,353
<font color="#FFFFFF">I can't wait to read what's next...</font>

101
00:16:16,022 --> 00:16:17,320
<font color="#FFFFFF">R-Really?</font>

102
00:16:17,350 --> 00:16:19,848
<font color="#FFFFFF">Did you really figure out
Kakashi Sensei's weakness?</font>

103
00:16:22,046 --> 00:16:23,744
<font color="#FFFFFF">You should be able to figure it out</font>

104
00:16:23,784 --> 00:16:27,081
<font color="#FFFFFF">if you look back on
his actions up until now.</font>

105
00:16:27,510 --> 00:16:32,036
<font color="#FFFFFF">Quit stalling already...
What's his weakness, Naruto?</font>

106
00:16:33,834 --> 00:16:36,102
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well, you see...</font>

107
00:16:41,396 --> 00:16:42,825
<font color="#FFFFFF">I get it!</font>

108
00:16:43,095 --> 00:16:45,962
<font color="#FFFFFF">I never thought he'd have
a weakness like that.</font>

109
00:16:46,521 --> 00:16:50,287
<font color="#FFFFFF">See? It's clear if you think back
on his actions up until now, right?</font>

110
00:16:51,486 --> 00:16:52,715
<font color="#FFFFFF">Right, right.</font>

111
00:16:53,154 --> 00:16:54,983
<font color="#FFFFFF">In addition to occupying
both his hands,</font>

112
00:16:55,013 --> 00:16:57,410
<font color="#FFFFFF">we might be able to seal off
his Sharingan if things go well.</font>

113
00:16:57,650 --> 00:16:59,708
<font color="#FFFFFF">And then if we seize the opportunity...</font>

114
00:16:59,748 --> 00:17:00,807
<font color="#FFFFFF">Naruto...</font>

115
00:17:00,847 --> 00:17:04,004
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sure enough, you're the number one
most unpredictable Ninja!</font>

116
00:17:06,701 --> 00:17:09,398
<font color="#FFFFFF">Still, I was so pleased with
how much they've grown</font>

117
00:17:09,438 --> 00:17:11,096
<font color="#FFFFFF">that I ended up getting
kind of carried away...</font>

118
00:17:11,896 --> 00:17:15,632
<font color="#FFFFFF">I guess this time I'll wait and see
what kind of move they'll make.</font>

119
00:17:16,591 --> 00:17:19,088
<font color="#FFFFFF">Now that that's settled,
the first strike will decide this!</font>

120
00:17:19,188 --> 00:17:21,186
<font color="#FFFFFF">We'll make the first move!</font>

121
00:17:21,556 --> 00:17:23,184
<font color="#FFFFFF">Right! Let's go!</font>

122
00:17:29,978 --> 00:17:30,977
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right.</font>

123
00:17:39,808 --> 00:17:41,436
<font color="#FFFFFF">They're fast, this time.</font>

124
00:17:55,822 --> 00:17:56,821
<font color="#FFFFFF">Gaara!</font>

125
00:18:11,036 --> 00:18:12,006
<font color="#FFFFFF">They're here.</font>

126
00:18:21,566 --> 00:18:22,925
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're underestimating me.</font>

127
00:18:23,594 --> 00:18:25,892
<font color="#FFFFFF">To think you'd attack me
head-on like that.</font>

128
00:18:29,258 --> 00:18:30,817
<font color="#FFFFFF">Now, Naruto!</font>

129
00:18:30,917 --> 00:18:32,885
<font color="#FFFFFF">Here we go, Kakashi Sensei!</font>

130
00:18:34,283 --> 00:18:37,550
<font color="#FFFFFF">At the end of "Make-Out Tactics...!"</font>

131
00:18:37,710 --> 00:18:40,307
<font color="#FFFFFF">Wh-What?</font>

132
00:18:41,106 --> 00:18:43,374
<font color="#FFFFFF">As it happens, the main character...!</font>

133
00:18:43,874 --> 00:18:46,101
<font color="#FFFFFF">He's giving away the ending!
N-No!</font>

134
00:18:51,266 --> 00:18:53,564
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, no! I still understand
what he's saying.</font>

135
00:18:53,594 --> 00:18:56,031
<font color="#FFFFFF">I can read his lips with my Sharingan.</font>

136
00:19:10,147 --> 00:19:10,976
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh!</font>

137
00:19:13,144 --> 00:19:15,372
<font color="#FFFFFF">A Ninja is supposed to read
below what's underneath.</font>

138
00:19:15,542 --> 00:19:17,170
<font color="#FFFFFF">Right, Sensei?</font>

139
00:19:18,709 --> 00:19:19,808
<font color="#FFFFFF">You got me...</font>

140
00:19:37,850 --> 00:19:41,146
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's just like an eggshell
protecting what's inside.</font>

141
00:19:47,610 --> 00:19:51,076
<font color="#FFFFFF">But it's incredible that he was able
to block the explosion completely.</font>

142
00:19:59,828 --> 00:20:01,566
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sand Prison!</font>

143
00:21:38,469 --> 00:21:39,927
<font color="#FFFFFF">Who'd have thought you'd
ensnare Kakashi</font>

144
00:21:39,967 --> 00:21:41,196
<font color="#FFFFFF">by pretending to give away
the ending.</font>

145
00:21:41,226 --> 00:21:42,525
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's a pretty good strategy.</font>

146
00:21:42,695 --> 00:21:45,262
<font color="#FFFFFF">- You could say that.
- But if I remember correctly,</font>

147
00:21:45,292 --> 00:21:46,661
<font color="#FFFFFF">Master Jiraiya's book is
targeted for adults, right?</font>

148
00:21:46,761 --> 00:21:48,459
<font color="#FFFFFF">So when did you become an adult?</font>

149
00:21:48,489 --> 00:21:50,557
<font color="#FFFFFF">That doesn't count as reading.</font>

150
00:21:50,587 --> 00:21:52,884
<font color="#FFFFFF">It was so boring
I quit after just ten pages...</font>

151
00:21:52,914 --> 00:21:54,413
<font color="#FFFFFF">It seems he read ten pages.</font>

152
00:21:54,483 --> 00:21:56,111
<font color="#FFFFFF">- Okay, you're guilty!
- Huh?</font>

153
00:21:56,151 --> 00:21:57,879
<font color="#FFFFFF">Naruto, for violating the regulations,</font>

154
00:21:57,909 --> 00:22:00,647
<font color="#FFFFFF">you are sentenced to clean
the Academy bathrooms for three days!</font>

155
00:22:00,777 --> 00:22:01,875
<font color="#FFFFFF">No way!</font>

156
00:22:02,175 --> 00:22:04,573
<font color="#FFFFFF">Next episode:
"The Kazekage Stands Tall"</font>

